-    Exp6900 contains 1,400 terminal acquisition cells from all three required GGUF families, Enoki,
-    and a rule control. The shared adversarial verifier quarantined its positive verdict because
-    `duration_s` and `live_duration_s` were byte-identical. Exp6901 therefore scored no semantics.
-    The raw acquisition must remain immutable. V605 needs a fresh reducer receipt with independent
-    duration definitions before any semantic task can read the rows.
